<section class="sec" id="why">
<div class="wrap">
<span class="eyebrow reveal">Why now</span>
<h2 class="st reveal">Why data science and AI, and <span class="serif">why now.</span></h2>
<p class="lede reveal">AI moved from research labs into every product roadmap, and companies now hire for applied skills: people who can clean data, train a sensible model, evaluate it honestly and ship it. That applied layer, not PhD research, is where the jobs are.</p>
<div class="why-stats">
<div class="ws reveal"><b>#1</b><span class="t">Fastest-growing tech role</span><p>AI and ML specialist roles top every growth ranking of technical jobs.</p></div>
<div class="ws reveal"><b>GenAI</b><span class="t">A new job family</span><p>LLM application skills created roles that did not exist three years ago.</p></div>
